  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "Integrating Outlook Sign-In with eCommerceGo SaaS provides a seamless and secure way for users to access their accounts using their existing Microsoft credentials. This integration enhances the user experience by allowing customers to sign in quickly and effortlessly, leveraging the security and convenience of their Outlook accounts. By offering Outlook Sign-In, businesses can streamline the login process, reduce the friction associated with creating and remembering new credentials, and provide a familiar authentication method for users already comfortable with Microsoft services.": "Integrering af Outlook-login med eCommerceGo SaaS giver en problemfri og sikker måde for brugere at få adgang til deres konti ved hjælp af deres eksisterende Microsoft-legitimationsoplysninger. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
  "Enabling Outlook Sign-In Integration": "Aktivering af Outlook-login-integration",
  "To enable Outlook Sign-In within your eCommerceGo SaaS platform, you need to access the authentication settings in your admin dashboard. From there, select Outlook as an available sign-in method. The setup process involves configuring the necessary OAuth credentials and permissions, which Microsoft provides. Detailed documentation and support resources are available to guide you through this process, ensuring a smooth and straightforward integration. Once enabled, users can start signing in with their Outlook accounts, improving the overall user experience.": "For at aktivere Outlook-logon på din eCommerceGo SaaS-platform skal du have adgang til godkendelsesindstillingerne i dit admin-dashboard. ",
  "Configuring Authentication Settings": "Konfiguration af godkendelsesindstillinger",
  "After enabling Outlook Sign-In, the next step is to configure the authentication settings to ensure optimal security and user management. This includes entering your Microsoft Azure application credentials, setting up callback URLs, and defining user roles and permissions within eCommerceGo SaaS. Proper configuration is crucial for maintaining a secure authentication process and ensuring that user data is protected. Comprehensive guides and best practices are provided to help you navigate this configuration, ensuring that your integration is both secure and efficient.": "Efter at have aktiveret Outlook Log-In, er næste trin at konfigurere godkendelsesindstillingerne for at sikre optimal sikkerhed og brugerstyring. ",
  "User Experience with Outlook Sign-In": "Brugererfaring med Outlook-login",
  "With Outlook Sign-In integrated into eCommerceGo SaaS, users will benefit from a streamlined and familiar login process. During sign-in, users can choose to authenticate via their Outlook accounts, which redirects them to the secure Microsoft login page. After successfully entering their credentials, they are redirected back to eCommerceGo SaaS, logged in and ready to use the platform. This seamless process reduces login friction, enhances security, and increases user satisfaction. Additionally, users who prefer Outlook will appreciate the convenience of using their existing credentials.": "Med Outlook Sign-In integreret i eCommerceGo SaaS vil brugerne drage fordel af en strømlinet og velkendt login-proces. ",
